            "review_text": "linda L\nMelun, France34 contributions\n0\nCon artists\nAug 2024 • Family\nCon artists\nAfter welcoming us with open arms, the waiter made us choose at the aquariums. The dishes follow one another and we explain to him that we did not order all this. The bill turned out to be very salty. Much more expensive than any restaurant around here. The waiter did not want to hear anything and demanded that we settle. We were with family with children. The waiter physically assaulted us and went to the kitchen to get a 50 cm knife and threatened to kill us. After taking the family to safety, the police were called. The waiter denied the assault. A complaint was filed. \nRestaurant to flee ....\nRead more\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten August 24, 2024",
