            "review_title": "Review at Quán Ốc, Hải Sản K-tin 30k",
            "review_text": "silverelb\nDa Nang, Vietnam183 contributions\n0\nVery good food but quite expensive for small group\nNov 2022 • Friends\nFirst time I came here with my coworkers, so we were around 20 people and share bill so it's not so expensive. Then I came back again, but for 2 people it's really quite big (should not named 30k because they don't have that price). But the food is very delicious, actually quite bold flavor that I never used extra dip they provided. They have deep fried sweet potatoes with butter, which is my favorite, but it's not on the menu, so it's like a hidden item haha. If I have chance to go out with big group, I definitely recommend my people to come here\nRead more\nWritten December 11, 2022",
